flowchart TD
    LOOP[Bearerbox requeue thread] --> BBON{Bearerbox online?}
    BBON -->|no| WAIT[Sleep / retry]
    BBON -->|yes| MODE{store-primary?}

    MODE -->|yes + enable-queue| GETQ[get_queue_stored mt_push]
    GETQ --> QSTORE[(smpp_store_queue)]
    QSTORE --> REQUEUE[Outbound queue → SMSC]
    REQUEUE -->|success| DEL[remove global_id]

    MODE -->|no| GETS[get_stored mt_push]
    GETS --> LEGACY[(smpp_store_queue or smpp_store)]

    BBON --> MO[get_stored mo]
    MO --> PRIMARY[(smpp_store primary)]
    PRIMARY --> ROUTE[Route to ESME]
